#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:5
msgid "class Pin -- control I/O pins"
msgstr "class Pin -- 控制 I/O 接腳"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:7
msgid ""
"A pin object is used to control I/O pins (also known as GPIO - general-"
"purpose input/output).  Pin objects are commonly associated with a physical "
"pin that can drive an output voltage and read input voltages.  The pin class"
" has methods to set the mode of the pin (IN, OUT, etc) and methods to get "
"and set the digital logic level. For analog control of a pin, see the "
":class:`ADC` class."
msgstr ""
"接腳物件用於控制 I/O 接腳（也稱為 GPIO，即通用輸入/輸出）。接腳物件通常與一個實體接腳相關聯，該接腳可以驅動輸出電壓並讀取輸入電壓。Pin "
"類別提供了設定接腳模式（IN、OUT 等）的方法，以及取得和設定數位邏輯位準的方法。若要對接腳進行類比控制，請參閱 :class:`ADC` 類別。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:13
msgid ""
"A pin object is constructed by using an identifier which unambiguously "
"specifies a certain I/O pin.  The allowed forms of the identifier and the "
"physical pin that the identifier maps to are port-specific.  Possibilities "
"for the identifier are an integer, a string or a tuple with port and pin "
"number."
msgstr ""
"接腳物件是透過一個明確指定某個 I/O "
"接腳的識別碼來建構的。識別碼允許的格式以及識別碼所對應的實體接腳是依連接埠而定的。識別碼可以是整數、字串，或是包含連接埠與接腳編號的 tuple。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:19
msgid "Usage Model::"
msgstr "使用模型::"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:43
msgid "Constructors"
msgstr "建構函式"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:47
msgid ""
"Access the pin peripheral (GPIO pin) associated with the given ``id``.  If "
"additional arguments are given in the constructor then they are used to "
"initialise the pin.  Any settings that are not specified will remain in "
"their previous state."
msgstr ""
"存取與給定 ``id`` 相關聯的接腳周邊裝置（GPIO "
"接腳）。如果建構函式中提供了額外的引數，則會使用這些引數來初始化接腳。任何未指定的設定都會維持其先前的狀態。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:51 ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:174
msgid "The arguments are:"
msgstr "引數為："

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:53
msgid ""
"``id`` is mandatory and can be an arbitrary object.  Among possible value "
"types are: int (an internal Pin identifier), str (a Pin name), and tuple "
"(pair of [port, pin])."
msgstr ""
"``id`` 為必填，可以是任意物件。可能的值類型包括：int（內部接腳識別碼）、str（接腳名稱）以及 tuple（[port, pin] 的配對）。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:57
msgid "``mode`` specifies the pin mode, which can be one of:"
msgstr "``mode`` 指定接腳模式，可以是下列其中之一："

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:59
msgid ""
"``Pin.IN`` - Pin is configured for input.  If viewed as an output the pin is"
" in high-impedance state."
msgstr "``Pin.IN`` - 接腳設定為輸入。若視為輸出，則接腳處於高阻抗狀態。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:62
msgid "``Pin.OUT`` - Pin is configured for (normal) output."
msgstr "``Pin.OUT`` - 接腳設定為（一般）輸出。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:64
msgid ""
"``Pin.OPEN_DRAIN`` - Pin is configured for open-drain output. Open-drain "
"output works in the following way: if the output value is set to 0 the pin "
"is active at a low level; if the output value is 1 the pin is in a high-"
"impedance state.  Not all ports implement this mode, or some might only on "
"certain pins."
msgstr ""
"``Pin.OPEN_DRAIN`` - 接腳設定為開汲極輸出。開汲極輸出的運作方式如下：若輸出值設為 0，接腳在低位準時為作用狀態；若輸出值為 "
"1，接腳則處於高阻抗狀態。並非所有連接埠都實作此模式，或某些連接埠僅在特定接腳上實作。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:69
msgid ""
"``Pin.ALT`` - Pin is configured to perform an alternative function, which is"
" port specific.  For a pin configured in such a way any other Pin methods "
"(except :meth:`Pin.init`) are not applicable (calling them will lead to "
"undefined, or a hardware-specific, result).  Not all ports implement this "
"mode."
msgstr ""
"``Pin.ALT`` - 接腳設定為執行替代功能，此功能依連接埠而定。對於以此方式設定的接腳，任何其他 Pin 方法（除了 "
":meth:`Pin.init`\\ ）皆不適用（呼叫它們將導致未定義或硬體特定的結果）。並非所有連接埠都實作此模式。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:74
msgid ""
"``Pin.ALT_OPEN_DRAIN`` - The Same as ``Pin.ALT``, but the pin is configured "
"as open-drain.  Not all ports implement this mode."
msgstr "``Pin.ALT_OPEN_DRAIN`` - 與 ``Pin.ALT`` 相同，但接腳設定為開汲極。並非所有連接埠都實作此模式。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:77
msgid ""
"``Pin.ANALOG`` - Pin is configured for analog input, see the :class:`ADC` "
"class."
msgstr "``Pin.ANALOG`` - 接腳設定為類比輸入，請參閱 :class:`ADC` 類別。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:79
msgid ""
"``pull`` specifies if the pin has a (weak) pull resistor attached, and can "
"be one of:"
msgstr "``pull`` 指定接腳是否連接了（弱）上拉/下拉電阻，可以是下列其中之一："

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:82
msgid "``None`` - No pull up or down resistor."
msgstr "``None`` - 無上拉或下拉電阻。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:83
msgid "``Pin.PULL_UP`` - Pull up resistor enabled."
msgstr "``Pin.PULL_UP`` - 啟用上拉電阻。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:84
msgid "``Pin.PULL_DOWN`` - Pull down resistor enabled."
msgstr "``Pin.PULL_DOWN`` - 啟用下拉電阻。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:86
msgid ""
"``value`` is valid only for Pin.OUT and Pin.OPEN_DRAIN modes and specifies "
"initial output pin value if given, otherwise the state of the pin peripheral"
" remains unchanged."
msgstr ""
"``value`` 僅對 Pin.OUT 和 Pin.OPEN_DRAIN 模式有效，若提供則指定初始輸出接腳值，否則接腳周邊裝置的狀態維持不變。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:90
msgid ""
"``drive`` specifies the output power of the pin and can be one of: "
"``Pin.DRIVE_0``, ``Pin.DRIVE_1``, etc., increasing in drive strength.  The "
"actual current driving capabilities are port dependent.  Not all ports "
"implement this argument."
msgstr ""
"``drive`` 指定接腳的輸出功率，可以是下列其中之一：\\ ``Pin.DRIVE_0``\\ 、\\ ``Pin.DRIVE_1`` "
"等，驅動強度依序遞增。實際的電流驅動能力依連接埠而定。並非所有連接埠都實作此引數。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:94
msgid ""
"``alt`` specifies an alternate function for the pin and the values it can "
"take are port dependent.  This argument is valid only for ``Pin.ALT`` and "
"``Pin.ALT_OPEN_DRAIN`` modes.  It may be used when a pin supports more than "
"one alternate function.  If only one pin alternate function is supported the"
" this argument is not required.  Not all ports implement this argument."
msgstr ""
"``alt`` 為接腳指定一個替代功能，其可取的值依連接埠而定。此引數僅對 ``Pin.ALT`` 和 ``Pin.ALT_OPEN_DRAIN`` "
"模式有效。當某個接腳支援多個替代功能時可使用此引數。若僅支援一個接腳替代功能，則不需要此引數。並非所有連接埠都實作此引數。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:100
msgid ""
"As specified above, the Pin class allows to set an alternate function for a "
"particular pin, but it does not specify any further operations on such a "
"pin.  Pins configured in alternate-function mode are usually not used as "
"GPIO but are instead driven by other hardware peripherals.  The only "
"operation supported on such a pin is re-initialising, by calling the "
"constructor or :meth:`Pin.init` method.  If a pin that is configured in "
"alternate-function mode is re-initialised with ``Pin.IN``, ``Pin.OUT``, or "
"``Pin.OPEN_DRAIN``, the alternate function will be removed from the pin."
msgstr ""
"如上所述，Pin 類別允許為特定接腳設定替代功能，但並未指定對此類接腳的任何後續操作。設定為替代功能模式的接腳通常不會用作 "
"GPIO，而是由其他硬體周邊裝置驅動。對此類接腳唯一支援的操作是重新初始化，方法是呼叫建構函式或 :meth:`Pin.init` "
"方法。若一個設定為替代功能模式的接腳以 ``Pin.IN``\\ 、\\ ``Pin.OUT`` 或 ``Pin.OPEN_DRAIN`` "
"重新初始化，則該替代功能將從接腳上移除。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:109
msgid "Methods"
msgstr "方法"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:113
msgid ""
"Re-initialise the pin using the given parameters.  Only those arguments that"
" are specified will be set.  The rest of the pin peripheral state will "
"remain unchanged.  See the constructor documentation for details of the "
"arguments."
msgstr "使用給定的參數重新初始化接腳。只會設定那些有指定的引數，其餘的接腳周邊裝置狀態將維持不變。引數的詳細資訊請參閱建構函式文件。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:117
msgid "Returns ``None``."
msgstr "回傳 ``None``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:121
msgid ""
"This method allows to set and get the value of the pin, depending on whether"
" the argument ``x`` is supplied or not."
msgstr "此方法可設定及取得接腳的值，取決於是否提供引數 ``x``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:124
msgid ""
"If the argument is omitted then this method gets the digital logic level of "
"the pin, returning 0 or 1 corresponding to low and high voltage signals "
"respectively.  The behaviour of this method depends on the mode of the pin:"
msgstr "若省略引數，則此方法取得接腳的數位邏輯位準，回傳 0 或 1，分別對應低電壓與高電壓訊號。此方法的行為取決於接腳的模式："

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:128
msgid ""
"``Pin.IN`` - The method returns the actual input value currently present on "
"the pin."
msgstr "``Pin.IN`` - 此方法回傳接腳上目前實際存在的輸入值。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:130
msgid ""
"``Pin.OUT`` - The behaviour and return value of the method is undefined."
msgstr "``Pin.OUT`` - 此方法的行為與回傳值是未定義的。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:131
msgid ""
"``Pin.OPEN_DRAIN`` - If the pin is in state '0' then the behaviour and "
"return value of the method is undefined.  Otherwise, if the pin is in state "
"'1', the method returns the actual input value currently present on the pin."
msgstr ""
"``Pin.OPEN_DRAIN`` - "
"若接腳處於狀態「0」，則此方法的行為與回傳值是未定義的。否則，若接腳處於狀態「1」，則此方法回傳接腳上目前實際存在的輸入值。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:136
msgid ""
"If the argument is supplied then this method sets the digital logic level of"
" the pin.  The argument ``x`` can be anything that converts to a boolean. If"
" it converts to ``True``, the pin is set to state '1', otherwise it is set "
"to state '0'.  The behaviour of this method depends on the mode of the pin:"
msgstr ""
"若提供引數，則此方法設定接腳的數位邏輯位準。引數 ``x`` 可以是任何能轉換為布林值的東西。若轉換為 ``True``\\ "
"，接腳設為狀態「1」，否則設為狀態「0」。此方法的行為取決於接腳的模式："

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:141
msgid ""
"``Pin.IN`` - The value is stored in the output buffer for the pin.  The pin "
"state does not change, it remains in the high-impedance state.  The stored "
"value will become active on the pin as soon as it is changed to ``Pin.OUT`` "
"or ``Pin.OPEN_DRAIN`` mode."
msgstr ""
"``Pin.IN`` - 該值儲存在接腳的輸出緩衝區中。接腳狀態不會改變，仍維持在高阻抗狀態。一旦接腳變更為 ``Pin.OUT`` 或 "
"``Pin.OPEN_DRAIN`` 模式，儲存的值便會在接腳上生效。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:145
msgid "``Pin.OUT`` - The output buffer is set to the given value immediately."
msgstr "``Pin.OUT`` - 輸出緩衝區立即設為給定的值。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:146
msgid ""
"``Pin.OPEN_DRAIN`` - If the value is '0' the pin is set to a low voltage "
"state.  Otherwise the pin is set to high-impedance state."
msgstr "``Pin.OPEN_DRAIN`` - 若值為「0」，接腳設為低電壓狀態。否則接腳設為高阻抗狀態。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:149
msgid "When setting the value this method returns ``None``."
msgstr "設定值時，此方法回傳 ``None``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:153
msgid ""
"Pin objects are callable.  The call method provides a (fast) shortcut to set"
" and get the value of the pin.  It is equivalent to Pin.value([x]). See "
":meth:`Pin.value` for more details."
msgstr ""
"接腳物件是可呼叫的。呼叫方法提供了一個（快速的）捷徑來設定及取得接腳的值。它等同於 Pin.value([x])。詳細資訊請參閱 "
":meth:`Pin.value`\\ 。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:159
msgid "Set pin to \"1\" output level."
msgstr "將接腳設為「1」輸出位準。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:163
msgid "Set pin to \"0\" output level."
msgstr "將接腳設為「0」輸出位準。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:167
msgid ""
"Configure an interrupt handler to be called when the trigger source of the "
"pin is active.  If the pin mode is ``Pin.IN`` then the trigger source is the"
" external value on the pin.  If the pin mode is ``Pin.OUT`` then the trigger"
" source is the output buffer of the pin.  Otherwise, if the pin mode is "
"``Pin.OPEN_DRAIN`` then the trigger source is the output buffer for state "
"'0' and the external pin value for state '1'."
msgstr ""
"設定一個中斷處理常式，在接腳的觸發來源為作用狀態時被呼叫。若接腳模式為 ``Pin.IN``\\ ，則觸發來源為接腳上的外部值。若接腳模式為 "
"``Pin.OUT``\\ ，則觸發來源為接腳的輸出緩衝區。否則，若接腳模式為 ``Pin.OPEN_DRAIN``\\ "
"，則狀態「0」的觸發來源為輸出緩衝區，狀態「1」的觸發來源為外部接腳值。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:176
msgid ""
"``handler`` is an optional function to be called when the interrupt "
"triggers. The handler must take exactly one argument which is the ``Pin`` "
"instance."
msgstr "``handler`` 為選用函式，當中斷觸發時會被呼叫。處理常式必須恰好接受一個引數，即 ``Pin`` 實例。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:180
msgid ""
"``trigger`` configures the event which can generate an interrupt. Possible "
"values are:"
msgstr "``trigger`` 設定可產生中斷的事件。可能的值為："

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:183
msgid "``Pin.IRQ_FALLING`` interrupt on falling edge."
msgstr "``Pin.IRQ_FALLING`` 在下降緣時中斷。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:184
msgid "``Pin.IRQ_RISING`` interrupt on rising edge."
msgstr "``Pin.IRQ_RISING`` 在上升緣時中斷。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:186
msgid "These values can be OR'ed together to trigger on multiple events."
msgstr "這些值可以用 OR 運算組合在一起，以在多個事件時觸發。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:188
msgid ""
"``priority`` sets the priority level of the interrupt.  The values it can "
"take are port-specific, but higher values always represent higher "
"priorities."
msgstr "``priority`` 設定中斷的優先順序層級。其可取的值依連接埠而定，但較高的值總是代表較高的優先順序。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:192
msgid ""
"``wake`` selects the power mode in which this interrupt can wake up the "
"system. Not supported on any OpenMV port; leave at the default."
msgstr "``wake`` 選擇此中斷能喚醒系統的電源模式。任何 OpenMV 連接埠均不支援；請保留為預設值。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:195
msgid ""
"``hard`` if true a hardware interrupt is used. This reduces the delay "
"between the pin change and the handler being called. Hard interrupt handlers"
" may not allocate memory; see :ref:`isr_rules`. Not all ports support this "
"argument."
msgstr ""
"``hard`` 若為 true 則使用硬體中斷。這會縮短接腳變更與處理常式被呼叫之間的延遲。硬體中斷處理常式不可配置記憶體；請參閱 "
":ref:`isr_rules`\\ 。並非所有連接埠都支援此引數。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:200
msgid "This method returns a callback object."
msgstr "此方法回傳一個回呼物件。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:202
msgid ""
"The following methods are extensions to the core Pin API. They are grouped "
"by port availability."
msgstr "下列方法是核心 Pin API 的擴充。它們依連接埠的可用性分組。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:206
msgid "Methods available on all OpenMV ports"
msgstr "所有 OpenMV 連接埠皆可用的方法"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:210
msgid "Set pin to \"0\" output level. Alias of :meth:`off`."
msgstr "將接腳設為「0」輸出位準。為 :meth:`off` 的別名。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:214
msgid "Set pin to \"1\" output level. Alias of :meth:`on`."
msgstr "將接腳設為「1」輸出位準。為 :meth:`on` 的別名。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:217
msgid "mimxrt + alif only"
msgstr "僅限 mimxrt + alif"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:221
msgid ""
"Toggle the output pin -- flip \"0\" to \"1\" or vice-versa. Not exposed on "
"STM32 (use ``value(not value())`` if you need this on STM32)."
msgstr ""
"切換輸出接腳——將「0」翻轉為「1」或反之。在 STM32 上未公開（若您在 STM32 上需要此功能，請使用 ``value(not "
"value())``\\ ）。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:226 ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:288
msgid "STM32 only"
msgstr "僅限 STM32"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:231
msgid ""
"Get or set the pin mode. See the constructor documentation for details of "
"the ``mode`` argument."
msgstr "取得或設定接腳模式。\\ ``mode`` 引數的詳細資訊請參閱建構函式文件。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:237
msgid ""
"Get or set the pin pull state. See the constructor documentation for details"
" of the ``pull`` argument."
msgstr "取得或設定接腳的上拉/下拉狀態。\\ ``pull`` 引數的詳細資訊請參閱建構函式文件。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:241
msgid "Constants"
msgstr "常數"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:243
msgid ""
"The constants below are used to configure :class:`Pin` objects via the "
"constructor, :meth:`init` and :meth:`irq`. They are grouped by port "
"availability."
msgstr ""
"下列常數用於透過建構函式、\\ :meth:`init` 和 :meth:`irq` 來設定 :class:`Pin` 物件。它們依連接埠的可用性分組。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:248
msgid "Constants available on all OpenMV ports"
msgstr "所有 OpenMV 連接埠皆可用的常數"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:253
msgid "Pin mode: high-impedance digital input."
msgstr "接腳模式：高阻抗數位輸入。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:258
msgid "Pin mode: push-pull digital output. Alias of :data:`OUT_PP` on STM32."
msgstr "接腳模式：推挽式數位輸出。在 STM32 上為 :data:`OUT_PP` 的別名。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:264
msgid ""
"Pin mode: open-drain output. Driving ``0`` pulls the line low; driving ``1``"
" releases it to high-impedance."
msgstr "接腳模式：開汲極輸出。驅動 ``0`` 會將線路拉低；驅動 ``1`` 則將其釋放至高阻抗。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:270
msgid "Enable the internal pull-up resistor on the pin."
msgstr "啟用接腳上的內部上拉電阻。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:275
msgid "Enable the internal pull-down resistor on the pin."
msgstr "啟用接腳上的內部下拉電阻。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:280
msgid "Pass to :meth:`irq` to trigger on a falling edge."
msgstr "傳遞給 :meth:`irq` 以在下降緣時觸發。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:285
msgid "Pass to :meth:`irq` to trigger on a rising edge."
msgstr "傳遞給 :meth:`irq` 以在上升緣時觸發。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:293
msgid ""
"Pin mode: alternate function (push-pull). Use with ``alt=`` to select which "
"peripheral function the pin is routed to. Alias of :data:`AF_PP`."
msgstr "接腳模式：替代功能（推挽式）。與 ``alt=`` 搭配使用以選擇接腳被路由到哪個周邊功能。為 :data:`AF_PP` 的別名。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:300
msgid "Pin mode: alternate function (open-drain). Alias of :data:`AF_OD`."
msgstr "接腳模式：替代功能（開汲極）。為 :data:`AF_OD` 的別名。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:306
msgid ""
"Pin mode: analog input -- the digital input/output buffer is disconnected so"
" the pin can be driven by an :class:`ADC` channel."
msgstr "接腳模式：類比輸入——數位輸入/輸出緩衝區被斷開，使接腳可由 :class:`ADC` 通道驅動。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:313
msgid "Alternate-function push-pull mode (same value as :data:`ALT`)."
msgstr "替代功能推挽式模式（與 :data:`ALT` 值相同）。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:318
msgid ""
"Alternate-function open-drain mode (same value as :data:`ALT_OPEN_DRAIN`)."
msgstr "替代功能開汲極模式（與 :data:`ALT_OPEN_DRAIN` 值相同）。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:324
msgid "Push-pull output mode (same value as :data:`OUT`)."
msgstr "推挽式輸出模式（與 :data:`OUT` 值相同）。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:329
msgid "Open-drain output mode (same value as :data:`OPEN_DRAIN`)."
msgstr "開汲極輸出模式（與 :data:`OPEN_DRAIN` 值相同）。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:334
msgid "Disable the internal pull-up / pull-down resistor on the pin."
msgstr "停用接腳上的內部上拉/下拉電阻。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:337
msgid "mimxrt only"
msgstr "僅限 mimxrt"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:342
msgid "Enable a ~47 kΩ internal pull-up resistor."
msgstr "啟用約 47 kΩ 的內部上拉電阻。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:347
msgid "Enable a ~22 kΩ internal pull-up resistor."
msgstr "啟用約 22 kΩ 的內部上拉電阻。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:352
msgid ""
"Enable the pad's bus-keeper / hold function -- the pin latches its current "
"logic level rather than floating."
msgstr "啟用接腳焊墊的匯流排保持器/保持功能——接腳會閂鎖其目前的邏輯位準，而非浮動。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:358
msgid "Disable the pin output driver."
msgstr "停用接腳輸出驅動器。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:363
msgid ""
"Lowest drive-strength setting (highest series impedance) -- the ``R0`` "
"reference (~150 Ω at 3.3 V / 260 Ω at 1.8 V)."
msgstr "最低驅動強度設定（最高串聯阻抗）——\\ ``R0`` 參考值（在 3.3 V 時約 150 Ω / 在 1.8 V 時約 260 Ω）。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:369
msgid "Drive strength one step above :data:`DRIVE_0`."
msgstr "比 :data:`DRIVE_0` 高一級的驅動強度。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:374
msgid "Drive strength two steps above :data:`DRIVE_0`."
msgstr "比 :data:`DRIVE_0` 高兩級的驅動強度。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:379
msgid ""
"Drive strength three steps above :data:`DRIVE_0` (default for output pins)."
msgstr "比 :data:`DRIVE_0` 高三級的驅動強度（輸出接腳的預設值）。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:385
msgid "Drive strength four steps above :data:`DRIVE_0`."
msgstr "比 :data:`DRIVE_0` 高四級的驅動強度。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:390
msgid "Drive strength five steps above :data:`DRIVE_0`."
msgstr "比 :data:`DRIVE_0` 高五級的驅動強度。"

#: ../../library/machine.Pin.rst:395
msgid "Strongest drive-strength setting."
msgstr "最強驅動強度設定。"
